    T3 --> T3Hit{Cache hit?}
    T3Hit -->|Yes, unpacked| Use
    T3Hit -->|Yes, zip only| Unzip[Unzip to temp dir]
    Unzip --> Use
    T3Hit -->|No| T4["agents/raml/examples/<br/>{api-name}-spec/"]
